When neither DBD::SQLite share dir nor a system sqlite3ext.h exists, $sqlite_inc stays empty and cc runs without -I, producing an opaque "sqlite3ext.h: No such file" compile error attributed to sqlite-vec. Fail early in the build sub with a clear diagnostic naming the missing header and how to provide it. Evidence: alienfile lines 20-46.
